      <link>https://www.ibtimes.co.in/sensex-nifty-open-higher-global-optimism-893122</link>
      <description>The Sensex rose 260 points, or 0.31 per cent, to 84,847, while the Nifty gained 88 points, or 0.34 per cent, to trade at 25,973 during early trading session. "The Nifty continues to remain range-bound, with resistance placed around 26,000–26,050 and near-term support at 25,750–25,800 ; a zone that may attract accumulation if tested," analysts said.</description>
